    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$sjoyasorrow_intro",
        "key": "$sjoyasorrow_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_268",
        "name2": "avg_npc_268",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Sigh!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elder A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_268",
        "name2": "avg_npc_268",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What's the matter?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elder B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_268",
        "name2": "avg_npc_268",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The 'Tsch\u00e4gg\u00e4tt\u00e4s' aren't letting us leave.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elder A"
    },
    {
        "text": "They said Enciodes instructed them to make sure we stay here, supposedly for our own safety.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elder A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_268",
        "name2": "avg_npc_268",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "See? This is exactly as I said. He is trying to lock us in here!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elder B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_268",
        "name2": "avg_npc_268",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The Great Elder is unconscious, the Saintess is yet to be coronated, and he insists the other two clans are traitors. The way I see it, he is definitely up to no good.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elder A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_268",
        "name2": "avg_npc_268",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Shh... *Sigh*... Talking about this is not going to do us any good. The Great Elder has always been in charge of the Court's affairs, and now that this has come to pass... What are we supposed to do?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elder B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_268"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is this all Kjeragandr's will...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elder C"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.51
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_174_slbell_1#8$1",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_174_slbell_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's difficult to say whether this is what Kjeragandr wanted, but I'm sure it will pain Her heart to see you so dejected.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_268",
        "name2": "avg_npc_268",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "G-Great Saintess!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elder A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_268",
        "name2": "avg_npc_268",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We... We are simply worried...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elder B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is there something to worry about?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_268"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Great Elder's condition... and the situation surrounding the clans...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elder C"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_174_slbell_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I just talked to the doctor. The Great Elder's outlook is not optimistic, but I'm sure Kjeragandr will have mercy on him given his leadership of the Vine-Bead Court for so many years. Have faith, the Great Elder will get better.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "text": "In the interim, I will take charge of all of the Court's decisions, big and small.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_268",
        "name2": "avg_npc_268",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Well...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elder A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_250_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Saintess was supposed take charge of Kjerag at the coronation, and the Great Elder has wanted to pass the baton to the Saintess for some time now. Given the extraordinary circumstances, what's stopping you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kjarr"
    },
    {
        "text": "Or do you elders have a better idea?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kjarr"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_268",
        "name2": "avg_npc_268",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You're just the head maid...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elder A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_268",
        "name2": "avg_npc_268",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Enough. Head Maid Kjarr has the right of it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elder B"
    },
    {
        "text": "We've always had faith in the Saintess's ability, and she is willing to step forward to calm the masses. There is no better arrangement.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elder B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_174_slbell_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You needn't worry, dear elders.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Considering what had happened at the ceremony, Enciodes indeed had a reason to do as he did.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_174_slbell_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And even if Enciodes harbored ill intentions, as long as I'm here, the Vine-Bead Court will be safe.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Before, the Saintess's presence on the Holy Hunt's grounds, although brilliant, was only eye-catching."
    },
    {
        "text": "But now, the Saintess radiates a certain aura that makes her impossible to defy."
    },
    {
        "text": "The elders look at each other, before lowering their heads to her."
    },
    {
        "text": "'As you wish, Saintess.'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_174_slbell_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Leave us, please.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_268",
        "name2": "avg_npc_268",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.51
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_174_slbell_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_250_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Phew...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_174_slbell_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_250_1#7$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Enya, you were incredible.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kjarr"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_250_1#7$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Really?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_250_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Really. I thought you'd be disappointed after you came back from the ceremony.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kjarr"
    },
    {
        "text": "Looks like I was worrying too much.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kjarr"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_174_slbell_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_250_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm disappointed alright.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "text": "But the last time I was disappointed, I couldn't say anything.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Back then, I had no way to fight for myself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_174_slbell_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_250_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "This time, even though I'm disappointed, I know that I have the power to make a change, no matter how little.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "text": "So I don't want to be left disappointed this time. I need to do something to stave off my disappointment.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_174_slbell_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_250_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Enya... You've grown up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kjarr"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_174_slbell_1#10$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_250_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I wish I could've stayed a child forever. Thinking about these things all day is just too much effort...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_174_slbell_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_250_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But you're right. I've grown up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
