        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Faith...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Great Elder"
    },
    {
        "text": "*Cough*...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Great Elder"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_268"
    },
    {
        "text": "Great Elder, you're awake!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Devotee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_258_1#3$1",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Quiet down.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Great Elder"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_268"
    },
    {
        "text": "Quieting.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Devotee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_258_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The ceremony... *cough*... What became of it? I... I remember interrogating the Browntail subject, but no more...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Great Elder"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_268"
    },
    {
        "text": "You were poisoned by Sir Arctosz. Then, Gnosis's appearance made things all the more complicated.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Devotee"
    },
    {
        "text": "In the end, Sir Arctosz and Matriarch Ratatos joined hands to take on Sir Enciodes, only for him to overwhelm them...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Devotee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_258_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's not what I wanted to hear.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Great Elder"
    },
    {
        "text": "What about the coronation ceremony? The Saintess? The transfer of powers?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Great Elder"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_268"
    },
    {
        "text": "The ceremony was cancelled... Sir Enciodes announced that it will resume once the Paleroches and the Browntails are dealt with.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Devotee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_258_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Great Elder"
    },
    {
        "text": "Enciodes... *cough*...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Great Elder"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where's the Saintess?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Great Elder"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_268"
    },
    {
        "text": "She... She is in her room right now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Devotee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_258_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Great Elder"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Little one, how does it feel to sit in a Tri-Clan Council meeting for the first time?"
    },
    {
        "text": "Great Elder... I never imagined that... the Tri-Clan Council's meetings would be so boring."
    },
    {
        "text": "The clan leaders only talked about things that concerned their families. Every time they talk about which family will put in more effort in the annual events, they aren't interested at all. They don't care about Kjeragandr."
    },
    {
        "text": "Hohoh, a smart one. I was right about you."
    },
    {
        "text": "Great Elder... Did you show me this on purpose?"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's right."
    },
    {
        "text": "Why?"
    },
    {
        "text": "Because you will one day become the Great Elder."
    },
    {
        "text": "Then, you'll understand just what this so-called faith stands for."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_258_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You... How long has it been since you came to the Vine-Bead Court?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Great Elder"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_268"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? 25 years, Great Elder.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Devotee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_258_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "In those 25 years... *cough*... how do you think the Vine-Bead Court and Kjerag have changed?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Great Elder"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_268"
    },
    {
        "text": "I... Aside from all that the Silverashes brought us, I do not think there has been any significant change.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Devotee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_258_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "These lands have not changed for a millennium.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Great Elder"
    },
    {
        "text": "The future ought to see no change either.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Great Elder"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_258_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "*Cough*... Help me up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Great Elder"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_268"
    },
    {
        "text": "But, Great Elder, your health...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Devotee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_258_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know my health... *cough*... better than anybody else.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Great Elder"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't have much time left.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Great Elder"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_268"
    },
    {
        "text": "But...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Devotee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_258_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Have the Saintess proceed to the great hall. Tell her... I must speak to her about something.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Great Elder"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
